Mostly this would just create a *new* identikit ascension kit. Ascending
without all three of poison resistance, magic resistance, and reflection
is really quite hard. Barring the Way of the Weasel, most characters
need to get MR from their cloak or body armour slots. Ring slots are
already under strong contention since the introduction of free action.

This leads me to repeat my old conclusion: Nethack's model of powerful
attacks (in some cases, powerful attacks you cannot afford to ever be
affected by) with perfect boolean defences is hopelessly broken. It
reduces the diversity of player equipment and reduces the diversity of
the items that can be introduced without breaking game balance.
